    "source": {
      "value": "crb"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This sprig of berry-festooned holly and mistletoe doesn't wilt or rot. It can be used as a primal focus, and it also grants the creature holding it a +1 item bonus to Nature checks. You squeeze juice from one of the berries and smear it onto a club or staff to cast shillelagh upon it. You can twine the sprig around the wrist of one hand and touch a tree to cast tree shape upon yourself, except instead of a becoming a tree, you become a vine on the touched tree."
    },
